OL,3,GNEWSATributes to councillor who died
OL,4,Aweeks after wedding
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a Sefton
OL,7,Fcouncillor who died suddenly, a month
OL,8,Fafter getting married.
OL,10,FCouncillor Helen Duerden, 55, who
OL,11,Frepresented Netherton North, suffered
OL,12,Fan aneurysm and died on Thursday,
OL,13,Fcouncil leader Marion Atkinson said.
OL,15,FDuerden, who was elected in 2024, was
OL,16,Fdescribed as "the kindest, most caring
OL,17,Fperson anyone could wish to meet".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
