OL,3,GNEWSATributes to councillor who died
OL,4,Aweeks after wedding
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Helen was always full of energy, joy
OL,7,Fand passion for the work she carried
OL,8,Fout as a Labour councillor in Netherton
OL,9,FNorth and as a volunteer development
OL,10,Fco-ordinator at Sefton Community
OL,11,FVoluntary Sector," Atkinson said.
